      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm putting together a script for my tech podcast. Can you give me a list of the most compelling reasons why the 'Right to Repair' movement is a necessary fight against corporate monopolies? I want to lean into the consumer advocacy angle for this segment.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
