      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. I want to make the 'pro-repair' side sound really bulletproof for my listeners. How should I frame the tech companies' counter-arguments? I want to make sure I don't accidentally make their excuses sound legitimate if they're just trying to protect their profits.",
